        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1862">

                <pb facs="1370" n="1254" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1254"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11H23/41.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 510.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my despatch No. 466 of April
                    9, in the case of Wm. T. Harrington, I have the honor to enclose a translation
                    of a note received from the Secretary of Foreign Affairs of Panama on
                    yesterday.</p>
                <p>The Department’s instruction herein No. 129 of April 27 was not received until
                    May 12, and I had not found the opportunity to transmit a note pursuant to same
                    before the receipt of the response of Señor Lefevre, and it is just as well I
                    think that this has happened.</p>
                <p>We have had to make a hurried translation. After carefully considering same I
                    shall respond to the arguments presented and in addition in compliance with said
                    instruction No. 139, unless I am impressed later that the matter should be
                    submitted to the Department for specific instructions.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Jennings Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1862-a1.xml" xpointer="d1862-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
